  "reasoning": "The defendant Liu2 obtained 24万元 from his partner by falsely promising to purchase a house, which constitutes fraud (诈骗). He also forged land-use certificates to obtain loans of 32万元 from a rural credit cooperative, which involves forging state-issued documents (伪造国家机关证件) and fraudulently obtaining loans, but the primary charge for the document forgery is the forgery offense.",
